Package: ooarp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: ARP CACHE TOOL
 Inspects and flushes neighbor discovery and ARP tables on local network segments.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
